## Phase 5: Verification

### T5.1 — Unit tests for termcap probes
- Test probe response parsing with mock terminal output
- Test timeout behavior (no response within 100ms)
- Test color profile detection with mocked env vars
- **Files:** new `internal/termcap/termcap_test.go`

### T5.2 — Unit tests for OSC 52 clipboard
- Test base64 encoding of various payloads
- Test >100KB rejection
- Test escape sequence formatting
- **Files:** new `internal/termcap/clipboard_test.go`

### T5.3 — Unit tests for color downsampling
- Given TrueColor theme + ANSI256 profile, verify colors are downsampled
- Given ANSI profile, verify 16-color mapping
- **Files:** new `internal/theme/theme_test.go` or add to existing

### T5.4 — Build verification
- `go build ./...` succeeds
- `go vet ./...` passes (pre-existing warnings acceptable)
- No new import cycles
- **Files:** CI / manual verification

### T5.5 — Manual testing matrix
- Test in: Ghostty, Kitty, Alacritty, tmux (over SSH), plain xterm, PuTTY (if available)
- Verify: no flicker (Mode 2026 terminals), clipboard works over SSH (OSC 52 terminals), colors degrade gracefully (256-color session), animations smooth and skippable
- **Files:** manual verification checklist
